  "offensiveAbilities": [
    {
      "name": "Blood Drain",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The giant mosquito has a creature grabbed</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The giant mosquito uses its proboscis to drain blood from the grabbed creature. This deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">3d6</span> damage, and the giant mosquito gains temporary Hit Points equal to the damage dealt. A creature that has its blood drained by a giant mosquito is Drained 1 until it receives healing of any kind or amount.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Septic Malaria",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [
        "disease"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The victim can't reduce its Sickened condition while it's affected by septic malaria</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 24 Fortitude save</p>\n<p><strong>Onset</strong> 1 day</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> Sickened 1 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> Drained 1 and Sickened 1 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> as stage 2 (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 4</strong> Unconscious (1 day)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 5</strong> dead</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>These horrifically enlarged versions of the common mosquito often prey upon megafauna like dinosaurs and other large creatures, but they won't turn down a chance to drink the blood of a smaller target-such as a humanoid.</p>",
  "recallKnowledge": "Nature, DC: 22",
